      "statement": "App Kustomizations declare dependsOn ordering contracts on the cluster infrastructure they require — topolvm (storage) when attaching volsync-new, external-secrets for ExternalSecret syncs, and the database operator (e.g. cloudnative-pg-cluster in the database namespace) for database-backed apps; optional sub-apps defined in the same ks.yaml (e.g. gitea-runner) repeat dependsOn independently and may omit unneeded substitutes.",
